# A1.06/A1_06_hobbies_and_time.letz
# Source: Quizlet "A1 Basics Beginner Luxembourgish Lesson 6"

@lesson A1.06 "Hobbies & Time"

# --- Hobby verbs / activities ---
@word kucken = to watch
@word liesen = to read
@word schwammen = to swim
@word schwamme goen = to go swimming
@word an de Kino goen = to go to the cinema
@word Tëlee kucken = to watch TV
@word danze goen = to go dancing
@word spadséiere goen = to go for a walk
@word Sport maachen = to do sports
@word um Internet surfen = to surf the web
@word Lëtzebuergesch léieren = to learn Luxembourgish
@word lafe goen = to go for a run
@word spillen = to play
@word Musek lauschteren = to listen to music
@word Bicher liesen = to read books
@word fléien = to fly

# --- Hobby nouns ---
@word de Sport = the sport
@word de Kino = the cinema
@word d'Tëlee = the TV
@word d'Musek = the music
@word de Piano = the piano
@word de Squash = the squash
@word d'Hobbyen = the hobbies
@word de Kanner = the children
@word den Aarbechtskolleeg = the work colleague

# --- Frequency ---
@word gär = with pleasure
@word ganz gär = very much
@word net gär = not happily
@word guer net gär = really not
@word dacks = often
@word net dacks = not often
@word heiansdo = sometimes
@word eemol = once
@word zweemol = twice
@word ni = never
@word am Mount = a month
@word an der Woch = a week
@word wéi oft = how often

# --- Time / o'clock ---
@word d'Auer = the hour
@word eng Auer = one o'clock
@word zwou Auer = two o'clock
@word dräi Auer = three o'clock
@word Véierel vir = quarter to
@word Véierel op = quarter past
@word hallwer = half past
@word moies = in the morning
@word vun = from
@word bis = until

# --- Modal verbs ---
@word kënnen = can
@word mussen = must
@word sollen = should
@word wëllen = to want
@word däerfen = to be allowed to
@word retten = to save
@word manipuléieren = to manipulate
@word dreemen = to dream
@word fëmmen = to smoke

# --- Adjectives & states ---
@word aventuriéis = adventurous
@word frëndlech = friendly
@word normal = normal
@word léiwer = preferably
@word genau = exactly

# --- Meeting & planning ---
@word de Rendez-vous = the appointment
@word d'Reunioun = the meeting
@word doheem = at home
@word de Restaurant = the restaurant

# --- Useful verbs ---
@word kommen = to come
@word sichen = to look for
@word sich kommen = to come pick up
@word treffen = to meet

# --- Sentences ---

@sentence
@lu Ech kucke gär Sport.
@en I like to watch sports.
@distractor-en TV
@distractor-en music
@distractor-lu Tëlee
@distractor-lu Musek

@sentence
@lu Ech kucken net gär Sport.
@en I don't like to watch sports.
@distractor-en TV
@distractor-en piano
@distractor-lu Tëlee
@distractor-lu Piano

@sentence
@lu Ech gi ganz gär spadséieren.
@en I like to go for a walk very much.
@distractor-en run
@distractor-en swim
@distractor-lu lafen
@distractor-lu schwammen

@sentence
@lu Ech gi guer net gär schwammen.
@en I really don't like to go swimming.
@distractor-en walk
